With the vault outside the repo, an existing `{vault}/specs` that is not a symlink to `{repo}/specs`
is a conflict: exit 1, `{repo}/specs` is not created and the vault directory is left as it was.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/home/Claude/probe/specs/rule/0001-keep.md --
keep
-- cmd --
booping specs init
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
specs init: {HOME}/Claude/probe/specs exists and is not a symlink to {CWD}/specs
